# Secret of the Damp Scroll (outlands 135): Shivivi in Norg (her script paths her about and has no onTrigger; the
# default 85), Hot_Springs in Horlais Peak (no script; the default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). A level 10 Warrior, fame 124,
# a Bone Chip. Shivivi: no section: 85. The Damp Scroll (a GM): still fame level 2: 85. Fame 125 (a GM): the scroll
# traded to her while available: no trade handler: nothing; 31 (the scroll), finished: begun. Accepted: Shivivi 32. Horlais Peak: Hot_Springs: the chip: nothing; the scroll with the chip: nothing;
# the scroll alone: 2 (the scroll); finished with a full inventory: complete false: the scroll kept; freed: 2 again,
# finished: completed (the Scroll of Jubaku: Ichi, Norg fame 30, Cracker of the Secret Code), the scroll taken
# (confirmTrade). Hot_Springs: the default; Norg: Shivivi 85.
lists Norg/Shivivi/onTrigger HorlaisPeak/Hot_Springs/onTrade HorlaisPeak/Hot_Springs/onTrigger Norg/onEventFinish/31 HorlaisPeak/onEventFinish/2
char zone=Norg pos=71.62,-6.281,-7.341 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Norg 124
item BoneChip
login
trigger Shivivi                         # fame level 2: the default 85 (she paths; the trigger walks to her)
finish
item DampScroll                         # a GM
trigger Shivivi                         # still level 2: 85
finish
fame Norg 125                           # a GM: level 3
trade Shivivi DampScroll x1             # available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Shivivi                         # 31 (the scroll)
finish                                  # begun
trigger Shivivi                         # 32
finish
warp 446.827,-37.752,-18.6 HorlaisPeak
trade Hot_Springs BoneChip x1           # not the scroll: nothing
trade Hot_Springs DampScroll x1 BoneChip x1   # not exactly: nothing
trade Hot_Springs DampScroll x1         # 2 (the scroll)
fill-inventory
finish                                  # inventory full: complete false: the scroll kept
free-inventory
trade Hot_Springs DampScroll x1         # 2
finish                                  # completed: the scroll, fame, the title; the damp scroll taken
trigger Hot_Springs                     # completed: the default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 71.62,-6.281,-7.341 Norg
trigger Shivivi                         # completed: no section: 85
finish
